Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 11:32:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Athena DTS: initial support + regulator/camera update,
 restructured for r35.6.4 kernel-dts layout

Squashes zbwu's two athena_l4t_jakku_dts commits (389f95e, b994542) and moves
the files from the r35.1 repo-root layout into r35.6.4 kernel-dts/. Stock
p3509 devkit DTBs stay enabled (zbwu's BUILD_ATHENA gating dropped).
